      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CRACKERJACK KEV (6) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 7 length win at this track in a handy 22.60. Jumping from the pinch draw but goes well at this distance. Well placed and can measure up. SOLID GROOVE (4) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Lochinvar Thor (22.69) in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Leading chance. ABOVE THEM ALL (3) boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten 2 lengths (22.74) behind Hara Hachi Bu at this track. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Hard to beat again. PAW OLYMPUS (8) was below best last time at this track (22.99) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 5.5 lengths sixth. Has an unbeaten record from this draw, scoring three times.",
